  acceptedAnswers:
  - Barbara Mandrell
  hints:
  - "Su cat\xE1logo registrado incluye \xABTonight My Baby's Coming Home\xBB, de
    1971, y llega hasta 2000."
  - "Se mueve dentro de country; \xABThe Midnight Oil\xBB refleja una energ\xEDa
    media y un pulso cercano a 113 BPM."
  - "Entre sus grabaciones figuran \xABNo Walls No Ceilings No Floors\xBB y \xABSleeping
    Single In A Double Bed\xBB."
  - "Tambi\xE9n lanz\xF3 \xABSleeping Single In A Double Bed - Single Version\xBB."
  - "Es el proyecto musical detr\xE1s de \xABI Was Country When Country Wasn't Cool
    - (Duet With George Jones)\xBB y \xAB(If Loving You Is Wrong) I Don't Want To
    Be Right\xBB."
